    "font" : "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "If we only consider the purely mechanical system as depicted in Figure 2(a), the global equations (1) can be generalized by:"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 14,
