    "bounding box" : [ 319.258, 448.178, 538.716, 482.175 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "MzCz  Kz  F (2) Where M, C, and K are respectively the mass,"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
