    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "damping, and stiffness matrices of the system."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 16,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 309.068, 387.81, 538.656, 435.868 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Solving the eigenvalues problem for the free undamped system yields the transformation matrix P between the modal coordinates q and the global coordinates z according [7]:"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 17,
