    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "z  Pq (3)"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 18,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 309.055, 296.419, 538.593, 357.013 ],
    "font" : "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
    "font size" : 9.96,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The premultiplication by PT allows to diagonalize M and K since both are symmetrical. Despite that C is also symmetrical, the damping matrix cannot be diagonalized and we can consider a linear combination of M and K [8]. Considering this, we now can express (2) as:"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
